menu "Philips air purifier client"

config PURIFIER_TIMEOUT_MS
    int "Sync reply timeout (ms)"
    default 12000
    help
        Measured 2026-09-27 on an AC2220: sync replies take 60-300 ms; 12 s is
        headroom for a busy network. Status is not affected: it arrives by Observe
        notification whenever the purifier pushes.

endmenu
